feature/
├── data/
│   ├── data_sources/
│   ├── models/
│   └── repository/
├── domain/
│   ├── entities/
│   ├── models/
│   ├── repository/
│   └── usecases/
└── presentation/
    ├── manager/
    ├── pages/
    └── widgets/
```

### Import Organization
- Use part files for widget organization
- Group imports logically
- Use relative imports within features
- Use absolute imports for core components

